{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/upside-living-srg-holding-limited-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":472,"crm_id":"67","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Upside Living","slug":"upside-living-srg-holding-limited-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["studio","apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"SRG Holding Limited","price":1458888,"display_price":"1.458M","lattitude":25.185279,"longitude":55.2873043,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":1,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Upside Living is a gated community that developer SRG Holding Limited plans to deliver in Q2 2023. The residential complex is located in the Business Bay business district. The building of the residential complex has 29 floors. The community features luxurious <strong>studio apartments and 1-bedroom residences.</strong>Recreation, entertainment and social facilities are within walking distance of the complex.The fashionable Business Bay area is located in the center of Dubai.The quarter, which is called Dubai Manhattan, is home to many world-class hotels. level and office centers. The project has a large selection of studios of 37 m2 and 54 m2 and residences with 1 bedroom of 50 m2 and 61 m2. In the apartments, living rooms combine dining and kitchen areas. Views of the Burj Khalifa come off the windows of the residences. Thanks to the wide glass doors leading to the balcony and panoramic windows during the day, the rooms are bright, which visually enlarges the rooms. By the time the complex is put into operation, all residential facilities will be fully furnished and equipped with household appliances. Designers will work on the interior of the residences.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.ama